MEMORANDUM
TO:
Mayor Marian Orr, and City Council
FROM:
Sara Vasquez, Purchasing Manager
DATE:
April 4, 2018
SUBJECT:
Consideration to purchase twenty (20)premium Ice Bumper Cars to be used at the
Ice&Events Centerfor the City of Cheyenne Community Recreation&Events
Department from IBC International, Steamboat Springs, CO.
The Ice &Events center is looking to purchase twenty(20) premium ice bumper cars in the
amountof148,700.00.
This is a sole source purchase through IBC International, Steamboat Springs, CO. They are the
only manufacture and distributer of ice bumper cars in the United States.
Funding Source:
022-26-2614-45-43102 (1% Sales tax 15-18)
```

