### Page 7 of 7 (scanned page: machine OCR, may contain errors)

```text
REQUEST TO PURCHASE OVER$35,000.00
The City of Cheyenne requests to purchase twenty (20) premium Ice Bumper Cars to be used at
the Ice&Events Center for the City of Cheyenne Community Recreation&Events Department
from IBC International, Steamboat Springs, CO in the amount of $148,700.00. This is a sole
source purchase; therefore, nobids were requested.
This will bereviewed by City Council at Finance on April 16,2018 andvoted on at the April 23,
2018 City Council meeting.
If youhave any questions, please call Sara Vasquez at 307/637-6345.
Sara Vasquez
Purchasing Manager
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WY
Publishedin: Wyoming Tribune-Eagle
Dates:
April6&13,2018
```
